{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793335796.740032, "run_id": "9d1ba81b50b64582b1799fcf1c3b56d5", "seq": 108, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "overview", "content": "overview（已读 pp.1-5）：论文把 agentic LLM 定义为 \"Agents that receive input in natural language from their environment, reason to make decisions, and take autonomous actions in affecting their environment, to achieve specific goals\"，并据三类能力 reason–act–interact 组织全文（p.1 摘要；p.2 目录为 2 Reasoning、3 Acting、4 Interacting）。三类相互促进：推理技术支撑助手行动，助手交互能力支撑社会模拟，行动与实验结果又可用于数据增强构成 virtuous circle（p.4 Figure 1）。文献选择见 p.5 \"1.2 Literature Selection\"：\"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"，且只选 LLM-based 工作。categories = [reason, act, interact]；search_methods = [google_scholar, snowballing]。局限：只覆盖当前现状，部分为未审稿预印本。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2", "ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5"], "section": "overview"}}
