{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793335948.2863734, "run_id": "9d1ba81b50b64582b1799fcf1c3b56d5", "seq": 163, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning", "content": "reasoning 笔记（pp.7-19）：2.1 Multi-step 含 CoT、Self Consistency、ToT（p.12 小标题 Search Tree）；2.2 Self Reflection（PHP、Self Refine、ReAct/Reflexion、Self Discover）；2.3 Retrieval Augmentation（RAG、自适应检索时机）；2.4 讨论称现代方法为 neurosymbolic，外部推理与控制算法结合。Self Consistency：采样多条推理路径后 selects the most consistent answer using majority voting，即 self_consistency_selection = majority voting。ToT 用外部控制算法搜索推理树，p.13 原文：\"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"，故 tot_search = [breadth_first, depth_first]。隐式推理（pp.16-17）：Self Taught Reasoner 用推理生成数据做 SFT；DeepSeek-R1 用 RL（GRPO/RLVR）把推理内化。p.18：RLVR 与 GRPO 用推理链，可按训练时间换模型规模。局限（pp.18-19）：自反思用同一 LLM 生成与评估，错误难调试、状态轨迹易超上下文；LLM 是 causal parrots，抽象/反事实推理与常识仍弱。p.18 System 1/2：推理是让正确答案逐步更可能被生成。对我 agent 的启示：反思需外部记录状态并把失败反馈写入笔记再重试。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4", "ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23"], "section": "reasoning"}}
