{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793335963.9297438, "run_id": "9d1ba81b50b64582b1799fcf1c3b56d5", "seq": 195, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "tool_use", "content": "tool_use 笔记（pp.20-29）：p.20 Acting 概览：agentic LLM 用行动与交互获取新数据，prompt learning 不改参数，须用 finetuning 固化。pp.21-22：WorldCoder 用 Python 程序学世界模型；VLA（CLIP、CLIPort、RT）纳入视觉与动作；Say Can 用价值函数约束不可行动作；Inner Monologue 把环境反馈以语言放进提示；Chain of Tools 提出 plan-execute-observe。p.23 Action Tools：API 对 LLM 只是另一种语言；Toolformer 自学何时调用、传参并整合结果。原文：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"，故 toolformer_tools = [calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation, calendar]。ToolBench 原文：\"contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI\"，toolbench_api_count = 16464。局限：工具选择与结果摘要是难点，p.23 用 planner/caller/summarizer 三个 LLM 分工。pp.27-29 应用：research、medical、science、trading assistants；SWE-Agent 提供建/改文件、导航仓库、执行程序的工具；AI Scientist 可从 idea 到论文，但实验有限且存在实现与视觉错误。对我 agent 的启示：工具需带 schema、参数校验与结果摘要步骤。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689", "ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f", "ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d"], "section": "tool_use"}}
