ed action、责任归属、伦理与法律问题约束。局限：综述聚焦当前工作，部分来源为未经同行评审的预印本。\",\n  evidence_ids=['ev-97c7764bd93b97111551','ev-2c646589154451e7b722'],\n  section='overview')\nprint(r)\n```", "reasoning_content": "We need continue. Need inspect pending evidence? Current delivered pages 30-31. We need pages 32-52 in batches. The next batch follows successful actions automatically if we do something? We must likely write a note or recall? Previous evidence ids page 30-31. Need capture multi_agent likely pages 31 onwards. We can write preliminary multi_agent note using page 31? But section 4 begins p31. We should perhaps recall missing evidence? No, pending batch has 8 ids not delivered; recall queued? We called recall earlier maybe. We shouldn't call task_status. Need action likely write_note multi_agent with pp.30-31 known content? But need answers CAMEL and Generative Agents. Not yet found. Better wait by recalling? Tool instructions: \"The next batch follows successful actions automatically.\" So any successful action advances delivery. Could write overview note update? But we need use received pages. We can update overview with pp.30-31: applications and ethics, section 4 starts. Then next batch delivered.\n\nNeed use write_note exact content in prose before code. We must supply evidence ids from delivered headers. Have ev-97c... p30, ev-2c64... p31. Write overview note preserving prior and add applications. Length <=1500. Let's compose Chinese note. Ensure exact content included in prose and same in literal."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8516, "completion_tokens": 889, "total_tokens": 9405, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 287}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4292}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
