{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793335969.5967085, "run_id": "9d1ba81b50b64582b1799fcf1c3b56d5", "seq": 206, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "overview", "content": "overview（已读 pp.1-5、30-31）：论文把 agentic LLM 定义为 \"Agents that receive input in natural language from their environment, reason to make decisions, and take autonomous actions in affecting their environment, to achieve specific goals\"，并按 reason–act–interact 三类能力组织全文（p.1 摘要；p.2 目录为 2 Reasoning、3 Acting、4 Interacting）。三类相互促进：推理支撑行动，行动与交互产生的新经验又可增强能力，构成 virtuous circle（p.4 Figure 1）。文献选择见 p.5：\"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"，且只选 LLM-based 工作；categories = [reason, act, interact]，search_methods = [google_scholar, snowballing]。pp.30-31 将行动能力落到科研、医疗、金融助手与机器人，并指出 AI Scientist/MLGym 尚难独立产生新颖科学突破，现实部署还受 grounded action、责任归属、伦理与法律问题约束。局限：综述聚焦当前工作，部分来源为未经同行评审的预印本。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-97c7764bd93b97111551", "ev-2c646589154451e7b722"], "section": "overview"}}
