{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793335981.2149563, "run_id": "9d1ba81b50b64582b1799fcf1c3b56d5", "seq": 239, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "multi_agent", "content": "multi_agent 笔记（pp.32-41）：第 4 节三层：LLM 社会能力、角色分工的成对小团队（4.2）、无预设角色开放社会（4.3）。4.1 含 conversation、etiquette/empathy、strategic、theory of mind；p.33 GTBench、EgoSocialArena（模型比人类低 11%）。4.2.2 CAMEL 让两个 LLM 扮演互补角色；p.37 原文 'By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal'，故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。p.38-39：多 agent 圆桌讨论、AutoGen、ChatEval 辩论、Sotopia、GovSim、NegotiationArena、狱警实验。p.39 原文 'Park et al. [2023] introduced Generative Agents, an environment where users can interact with a simulated town populated by 25 LLM-based agents.' p.40 AgentSociety 超 1 万 agents、AgentVerse 四阶段；p.41 OASIS 支持至一百万 agent，建于 CAMEL 之上。待 p.42+ 查 Generative Agents 可信度人类评估者人数及 outlook/Table 4 内容。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-2f8846ab5b1bc7072a1b", "ev-76027d4e758f97793930", "ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d", "ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba"], "section": "multi_agent"}}
