': 3742, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-bc885ff165a165a4d614', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:44', 'required': True, 'page': 44, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 2323, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-fdbf1c532c2133190b0f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:45', 'required': True, 'page': 45, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4456, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-75546d247dedb90561b5', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:46', 'required': True, 'page': 46, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4646, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:47', 'required': True, 'page': 47, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 5018, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:48', 'required': True, 'page': 48, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4375, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:49', 'required': True, 'page': 49, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4295, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-42cada09d7411017eb46', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:50', 'required': True, 'page': 50, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4663, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:51', 'required': True, 'page': 51, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3844, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:52', 'required': True, 'page': 52, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4072, 'exposed': False}], 'notes': {'overview': {'id': 'overview', 'content': 'overview（已读 pp.1-5、30-31）：论文把 agentic LLM 定义为 \"Agents that receive input in natural language from their environment, reason to make decisions, and take autonomous actions in affecting their environment, to achieve specific goals\"，并按 reason–act–interact 三类能力组织全文（p.1 摘要；p.2 目录为 2 Reasoning、3 Acting、4 Interacting）。三类相互促进：推理支撑行动，行动与交互产生的新经验又可增强能力，构成 virtuous circle（p.4 Figure 1）。文献选择见 p.5：\"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"，且只选 LLM-based 工作；categories = [reason, act, interact]，search_methods = [google_scholar, snowballing]。pp.30-31 将行动能力落到科研、医疗、金融助手与机器人，并指出 AI Scientist/MLGym 尚难独立产生新颖科学突破，现实部署还受 grounded action、责任归属、伦理与法律问题约束。局限：综述聚焦当前工作，部分来源为未经同行评审的预印本。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'ev-2c646589154451e7b722'], 'valid': True, 'request': 13}, 'reasoning': {'id': 'reasoning', 'content': 'reasoning 笔记（pp.7-19）：2.1 Multi-step 含 CoT、Self Consistency、ToT（p.12 小标题 Search Tree）；2.2 Self Reflection（PHP、Self Refine、ReAct/Reflexion、Self Discover）；2.3 Retrieval Augmentation（RAG、自适应检索时机）；2.4 讨论称现代方法为 neurosymbolic，外部推理与控制算法结合。Self Consistency：采样多条推理路径后 selects the most consistent answer using majority voting，即 self_consistency_selection = majority voting。ToT 用外部控制算法搜索推理树，p.13 原文：\"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"，故 tot_search = [breadth_first, depth_first]。隐式推理（pp.16-17）：Self Taught Reasoner 用推理生成数据做 SFT；DeepSeek-R1 用 RL（GRPO/RLVR）把推理内化。p.18：RLVR 与 GRPO 用推理链，可按训练时间换模型规模。局限（pp.18-19）：自反思用同一 LLM 生成与评估，错误难调试、状态轨迹易超上下文；LLM 是 causal parrots，抽象/反事实推理与常识仍弱。p.18 System 1/2：推理是让正确答案逐步更可能被生成。对我 agent 的启示：反思需外部记录状态并把失败反馈写入笔记再重试。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4', 'ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23'], 'valid': True, 'request': 9}, 'tool_use': {'id': 'tool_use', 'content': 'tool_use 笔记（pp.20-29）：p.20 Acting 概览：agentic LLM 用行动与交互获取新数据，prompt learning 不改参数，须用 finetuning 固化。pp.21-22：WorldCoder 用 Python 程序学世界模型；VLA（CLIP、CLIPort、RT）纳入视觉与动作；Say Can 用价值函数约束不可行动作；Inner Monologue 把环境反馈以语言放进提示；Chain of Tools 提出 plan-execute-observe。p.23 Action Tools：API 对 LLM 只是另一种语言；Toolformer 自学何时调用、传参并整合结果。原文：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"，故 toolformer_tools = [calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation, calendar]。ToolBench 原文：\"contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI\"，toolbench_api_count = 16464。局限：工具选择与结果摘要是难点，p.23 用 planner/caller/summarizer 三个 LLM 分工。pp.27-29 应用：research、medical、science、trading assistants；SWE-Agent 提供建/改文件、导航仓库、执行程序的工具；AI Scientist 可从 idea 到论文，但实验有限且存在实现与视觉错误。对我 agent 的启示：工具需带 schema、参数校验与结果摘要步骤。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d'], 'valid': True, 'request': 12}, 'multi_agent': {'id': 'multi_agent', 'content': \"multi_agent 笔记（pp.32-41）：第 4 节三层：LLM 社会能力、角色分工的成对小团队（4.2）、无预设角色开放社会（4.3）。4.1 含 conversation、etiquette/empathy、strategic、theory of mind；p.33 GTBench、EgoSocialArena（模型比人类低 11%）。4.2.2 CAMEL 让两个 LLM 扮演互补角色；p.37 原文 'By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal'，故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。p.38-39：多 agent 圆桌讨论、AutoGen、ChatEval 辩论、Sotopia、GovSim、NegotiationArena、狱警实验。p.39 原文 'Park et al. [2023] introduced Generative Agents, an environment where users can interact with a simulated town populated by 25 LLM-based agents.' p.40 AgentSociety 超 1 万 agents、AgentVerse 四阶段；p.41 OASIS 支持至一百万 agent，建于 CAMEL 之上。待 p.42+ 查 Generative Agents 可信度人类评估者人数及 outlook/Table 4 内容。\", 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-2f8846ab5b1bc7072a1b', 'ev-76027d4e758f97793930', 'ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d', 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba'], 'valid': True, 'request': 16}}}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8769, "output_tokens": 210, "total_tokens": 8979}, "is_final_answer": false}}
