AgentVerse 四阶段；p.41 OASIS 支持至一百万 agent，建于 CAMEL 之上。\",\n    evidence_ids=[\"ev-75546d247dedb90561b5\", \"ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886\"],\n    section=\"multi_agent\",\n)\nrecall([\"ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495\", \"ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f\", \"ev-42cada09d7411017eb46\", \"ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9\", \"ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3\"])\n```", "reasoning_content": "We need continue reading pending batch. Pages 48-52 likely delivered next. We should use read_pdf? No, PDF extraction already called; pending evidence ids are queued, and next batch follows successful actions. We need do an action that doesn't re-call read_pdf. We can recall pending evidence ids? The instruction says \"Continue the pending batch; do not reread unchanged sources.\" We can call recall with pending ids to queue? Actually recall queues evidence ids, batches are bounded. Let's call recall for the pending ids.\n\nAlso update multi_agent note with 100 human evaluators. But should we do that now? We have page 47 delivered. The note needs to be updated preserving facts and include generative_agents_evaluators=100. Let's update the multi_agent note now with evidence ids from page 46-47, adding 100 evaluators and CAMEL inception prompting exact quote. This is useful.\n\nNeed content 20..1500 chars, one contiguous string. Include both answers and quotes. Let's write note \"multi_agent\" content.\n\nThen recall pending ids? We can only output one fenced Python block per action and stop. We could do both in one code block (write_note then recall), but output budget okay. However, risk: recall delivery maybe after next action. Let's do write_note plus recall in one block? Instruction: \"Briefly describe the next action, then output ONE fenced Python block and STOP after it.\" We can include multiple statements. Do both.\n\nContent must occur verbatim in response prose? \"When calling write_note, include its complete exact content in the prose before the code and pass the same text as one content string literal.\" So I ne