, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793336134, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 906, "prompt_tokens": 8310, "total_tokens": 9216, "completion_tokens_details": {"_type": "CompletionTokensDetails", "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 301, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4224}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8310, "output_tokens": 906, "total_tokens": 9216}}, "model_output": "Table 4 (p.51) gives five topics — Training Data, Hallucination, Agent Behavior, Self reflection, Safety — and p.52's conclusion states all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification. Writing the final outlook note.\n\noutlook 主题笔记（pp.51-52）：Table 4 的研究议程五个 Topic 为 Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety，故 agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]；表中每个议题下列出具体挑战，如 Training Data 需 inference time reasoning data 与稳定 RL，Hallucination 用 self verification 与 mechanistic interpretability，Safety 涉及责任、隐私与公平（p.51）。结论重申三类能力互补：推理是基础，grounded retrieval augmentation 支撑机器人与工具使用，self reflection 支撑 theory of mind 等社会交互，\"and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification\"，故 shared_foundations = [reasoning, self_verification]（p.52）。行动与交互还反哺训练数据（Figure 1 循环），VLA 的泛化即为佐证。对我的 agent 的启示：应把 self verification 做成显式一步——写入报告前用 pytest 与逐问核对验证答案与引文页码；目前只校验结构与文件哈希，尚无自动事实核验与反思重试。\n```python\nwrite_note(title=\"outlook\", content=\"outlook 主题笔记（pp.51-52）：Table 4 的研究议程五个 Topic 为 Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety，故 agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]；表中每个议题下列