behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\" exact.\n- agenda_topics (p.51 Table 4): need exact text of table rows; quotes must support all five topics. Table extraction ordering may be messy. Need to check p.51 text carefully — continuous region containing all five topic names. Risky. Let me print p.51.\n- shared_foundations (p.52): \"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification\" exact.\n\nSo I need to print pages 1, 12, 37, 47, 51, 52 (and possibly 2) selected regions. Let's do a script that searches stored pages. Do I have `pages` dict? Let me print sorted(globals()) keys relevant.\n\nI'll do one action: read report.json + print stored page variables.\n\nLet me write code carefully with budget."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 9488, "completion_tokens": 1045, "total_tokens": 10533, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 975}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 5264}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
