4 APIs\n47 | 4.4.4 New Training Data. A final use case of this third part of the taxonomy is that new training data is generated\n48 | Training Data. The benefit from language corpuses that are used for pretraining of LLMs is said to be plateauing.\n50 | Self Reflection. Self reflection mechanisms are used in advanced prompt-improvement algorithms. Hand-writing\n50 | et al., 2024]? Self reflection by LLMs is another item for the research agenda.\n51 | Training Data       Finetune with inference time reasoning data\n51 | Self reflection     In-model self reflection and metareasoning\n52 | and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification. Closing the cycle, the acting and interacting\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8496, "output_tokens": 768, "total_tokens": 9264}, "is_final_answer": false}}
